<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants British Steel.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants British Steel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million European-style call warrants on ordinary shares of British Steel Plc, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.40 STG		  PREMIUM	8.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.175 STG		 GEARING	8.3 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   02.NOV.98		 PAYDATE	09.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1.45 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
